  "description": "Holt 2.0 – The evolution of our XC / Bikepacking multi-tool. All of our knowledge distilled into an XC hardtail.\n\nRidden to multiple victories by Alex McCormack, including the Highland Trail 550 (course record), the Atlas Mountain Race, and most recently a Hellenic Mountain Race win and course record on a production Holt 2.0. The bike is designed to be fast and efficient, with class leading compliance and comfort.\n\nSteel excels at making a short-travel hardtail. By not overbuilding the frame, we’ve been able to focus on maintaining the quality of the material, to deliver a ride that can only be steel.\n\nCompliance, traction, agility, zip, snap, grip, flow….a fast, off-road adventure machine.",
